    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze wa mumarayika aca anyereka rwa ruzi rw’amazi y’ubugingo, rubonerana nk’ikiyo, rutemba ruva ku ntebe y’inganji y’Imana n’iy’Umwagazi w’Intama, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "rukamanuka ruca hagati muri rya barabara rinini ryo mu gisagara. Ku mpande zompi z’urwo ruzi hari igiti c’ubugingo, cama cumi na kabiri mu mwaka, kikama uko ukwezi gutashe. Kandi amababi yaco ni umuti wo gukiza amahanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nta muvumo uzobayo, kuko intebe y’inganji y’Imana n’iy’Umwagazi w’intama zizoba ziri muri ico gisagara, kandi abakozi bayo bazoyisenga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bazobona mu nyonga hayo, kandi izina ryayo rizokwandikwa mu ruhanga rwabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nta joro rizobayo kandi nta muco w’itara canke w’izuba bazokenera, kuko Umwami Imana azobamurikira. Kandi bazoganza ibihe vyose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wa mumarayika arambarira ati: “Aya majambo ni ay’ukwizerwa kandi ni ay’ukuri. Umwami, Imana iganza impwemu z’abavugishwa, yarungitse umumarayika wayo kwereka abasavyi bayo ibigiye kuzoshika.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
